\subsection*{B.4 --- Fast sweeps: no images, no bar}

In campaigns with many executions, turn off all image generation (data CSVs are kept) and the progress bar. Run with uniform-length time series (disabling early stops) and order the CSV columns by field ($B$ first):
\begin{verbatim}
python3 compass.py --N 8 --M 8 --t_sim 1.0 \
    --make_images 0 --progress_bar 0 --t_sim_full 1 --csv_order B
\end{verbatim}
Speedup of $\sim 3\times$ in small arrays, where rendering dominates time.

