{"File":"/Users/jps/Dropbox/simula agulhas/project_report.tex","LineNumber":40,"LineContent":"This report documents the full development of the \\code{compass\\_sim} project: a Python simulator for two-dimensional arrays of magnetic compass needles interacting through complete dipolar coupling, with inertial Newtonian dynamics in SI units. The project began as a pedagogical demonstration of the analogy between compass arrays and magnetic materials, including hysteresis and domain formation, and evolved over six development sessions into a research instrument with publication potential. The report records the project decisions, problems encountered and solutions adopted, the code-version history (V20--V66), the research and publication strategy built around a gap identified in the literature, and the results of the pilot campaign on ``damping~$\\times$~hysteresis/avalanches''. The pilot already shows the central signal sought: a systematic increase of the avalanche exponent $\\tau$ with the quality factor $Q$."}
{"File":"/Users/jps/Dropbox/simula agulhas/project_report.tex","LineNumber":102,"LineContent":"\\paragraph{Simulator capabilities (current state, V66).}"}
{"File":"/Users/jps/Dropbox/simula agulhas/project_report.tex","LineNumber":176,"LineContent":"\\item \\textbf{Layout, terminal updates, and translations (V46--V66)}: docstring alignment (V46); autoscale parameter \\code{--hyst\\_autoscale} (V47); bugfixes and autoscale options (V48); HUD-needle overlap resolution and signed field bar updates (V49); progress bar English translation alongside a three-line console print layout (V50); HUD legend layout alignment alongside a constant-length field arrow position update (V51); full translation of all remaining terminal console prints and confirmations to English (V52); circular direction dial and sign indicator arrow next to the horizontal field bar updates (V53); terminal banner code version and developer metadata addition (V54); HUD direction dial arrow scaling with the removal of the sign indicator next to the bar (V55); HUD direction dial arrow scaling minimum length calibration (V56); HUD direction dial redesigned as a bold filled arrow using \\code{FancyArrow} (V57); HUD direction dial bold arrow homothetic scaling to preserve aspect ratio (V58); random per-needle damping noise support (V59); full translation of all CLI arguments and help text to English (V60); translation of Section 4 plotting label strings to English (V61); translation of the image suppression warning to English (V62); performance optimizations to the integration loop (V63); alignment of sweep files (V64); full translation of all sweep scripts to English (V65); and redesign of the HUD external field intensity bar to grow bidirectionally from center for positive/negative fields and zero at zero field (V66)."}
{"File":"/Users/jps/Dropbox/simula agulhas/project_report.tex","LineNumber":373,"LineContent":"\\section{Appendix: command-line parameters (V66)}"}
{"File":"/Users/jps/Dropbox/simula agulhas/project_report.tex","LineNumber":376,"LineContent":"Complete list of parameters accepted by \\code{compass\\_sim} in version V66, extracted directly from the program interface. Parameters marked ``auto'' are calculated from the real physical geometry when omitted and overridden when explicitly supplied."}
